{"id":"d6929d111b71d0b3","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md","title":"fact-diagonal-function-recursive — Diagonal Function is Recursive","display":"fact-diagonal-function-recursive — Diagonal Function is Recursive","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive","aliases":["90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive"],"display":"fact-diagonal-function-recursive — Diagonal Function is Recursive","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-function]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-diagonal-function-recursive — Diagonal Function is Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9aaef8df4fb1222b\" href=\"?note=9aaef8df4fb1222b\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-function\">90-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (coded substitution function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> (primitive-recursive syntactic operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(x)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(x,x)\">\\(D(x)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(x,x)\\)</span> (diagonal function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9aaef8df4fb1222b\" href=\"?note=9aaef8df4fb1222b\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-function\">90-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> (unary recursive-function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}function\\text{-}recursive}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\Longrightarrow\nD\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rec}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}function\\text{-}recursive}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\Longrightarrow\nD\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rec}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原始递归函数对变量识别闭合；因此把同一输入送入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 的两个位置仍是原始递归函数。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 编码一元公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(e)=\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\overline e)\\urcorner\">\\(D(e)=\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\overline e)\\urcorner\\)</span>；非法编码按上游定义取默认值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"9aaef8df4fb1222b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2$ (primitive-recursive syntactic operation, see [[90-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"9aaef8df4fb1222b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D(x)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(x,x)$ (diagonal function, see [[90-df-diagonal-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ (unary recursive-function class, see [[90-df-recursive-function-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"D(x)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(x,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}function\\text{-}recursive}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\Longrightarrow\nD\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rec}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v)","display":false},{"tex":"D(e)=\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\overline e)\\urcorner","display":false}],"bytes":1310,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["9aaef8df4fb1222b","abc082683aa1de80","137d75d038de4a47"]}